{
 "about": "Where scripts/i18n/extract.php, sync.php and scripts/i18n_check.php look for translation keys besides inventory.json (Preact t() keys are always read from resources/js). paths: folders/files scanned for literal __() / trans() / trans_choice() / @lang() / Lang::get() keys (PHP and Blade). config: config files whose arrays carry English labels that the views pass through __() at render time; the listed field names are collected anywhere in the array (an 'options' map contributes its labels, 'option_help' / 'more_options' maps their values). catalogs: public static methods (no arguments) or array constants (Class::CONSTANT, read by reflection) of classes whose arrays carry English labels the views render with __($label); the listed fields are collected anywhere in the returned array, a method may be called with literal arguments (\"Class::method('key', null)\"); \"*\" takes the labels of a flat value => label map, \"**\" every string at any depth (for arrays that hold nothing but labels). A class or member the project does not have (yet) is skipped and reported by extract.php. When a work package adds such a catalog or method, add it here.",
 "paths": ["resources/views", "app", "routes"],
 "exclude": [],
 "config": {
